[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274590444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363#issuecomment-3274590444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363","id":3274590444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DLkjs","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T11:46:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T11:47:27Z","body":"The part that I'm worried about regarding this PR is that there's no clear indication of what we're supposed to avoid to not break this particular device. Whoever decides to refactor or optimize this code in the future again will have no clear reason as to why they should avoid it, and we can't exactly test again unless whoever refactors it has access to it.\r\n\r\nSeeing as the reason behind the error is so vague, I'd say the ban list for FP16 on Intel would be the best approach for future maintenance (can be device/driver version based too). If the workaround is pushed as is, we at least need a link back to this PR denoting it is a highly fragile area of code in the specific device this bug was encountered on.\r\n\r\nAre we absolutely sure this bug only happens on this device and not elsewhere?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274590444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3276106332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363#issuecomment-3276106332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363","id":3276106332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DRWpc","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-10T18:39:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T18:39:51Z","body":"> The part that I'm worried about regarding this PR is that there's no clear indication of what we're supposed to avoid to not break this particular device. Whoever decides to refactor or optimize this code in the future again will have no clear reason as to why they should avoid it, and we can't exactly test again unless whoever refactors it has access to it.\r\n> \r\n> Seeing as the reason behind the error is so vague, I'd say the ban list for FP16 on Intel would be the best approach for future maintenance (can be device/driver version based too). If the workaround is pushed as is, we at least need a link back to this PR denoting it is a highly fragile area of code in the specific device this bug was encountered on.\r\n> \r\n> Are we absolutely sure this bug only happens on this device and not elsewhere?\r\n\r\n@DarioSamo No, I'm not sure. I'm judging based on the fact that this code has been in place for awhile and no one has complained. I am concerned about the increase in complexity and maintenance cost from a ban list if it turns out this is just an issue for a few device/driver combos.\r\n\r\nI am not super concerned about someone undoing this change in the future since these specific lines of code were pretty dubious to begin with. The fact that `spot_rim` needed to be in full precision anyway makes the preceding half calculations a lot less impactfull. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3276106332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299150244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363#issuecomment-3299150244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363","id":3299150244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EpQmk","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:40Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:40Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299150244/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299163780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110363#issuecomment-3299163780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110363","id":3299163780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EpT6E","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/re